     1473   PROCEDURE change-view :
     1474   define input parameter p-view as character no-undo.
     1475   display
     1476   rs-view
     1477   with frame Dialog-Frame.
     1478   assign
     1479   tt-c-fin-doc.exch-rate frame Dialog-Frame
     1480   tt-c-fin-doc.exch-scale
     1481   tt-c-fin-doc.sum-doc
     1482   .
     1483   hide
     1484   f-debet
     1485   f-credit
     1486   tt-c-fin-doc.cor-acc1-value
     1487   f-cor-acc1-descr
     1488   tt-c-fin-doc.cor-acc-value
     1489   f-cor-acc-descr
     1490   tt-c-fin-doc.an-uchet-value
     1491   f-an-uchet-descr
     1492   tt-c-fin-doc.cel-nazn-value
     1493   f-cel-nazn-descr
     1494   tt-c-fin-doc.cel-nazn-value
     1495   tt-c-fin-doc.perm-date
     1496   tt-c-fin-doc.user-name-perm
     1497   tt-c-fin-doc.fact-date
     1498   tt-c-fin-doc.user-name-fact
